   "source": [
    "summary = pd.DataFrame([\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'Method':              'Single temporal split (original)',\n",
    "        'Train wallets':       len(X_tr),\n",
    "        'Test wallets':        len(X_te),\n",
    "        'AUC':                 f'{auc_point:.4f}',\n",
    "        '95% CI':              f'{auc_lo:.4f} – {auc_hi:.4f}',\n",
    "        'Notes':               'Test set too small (n=205); CI width = ' + f'{auc_hi-auc_lo:.4f}',\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'Method':              'Walk-forward CV (6 folds)',\n",
    "        'Train wallets':       '1,200–8,500 (grows)',\n",
    "        'Test wallets':        f'{wf_df[\"test_size\"].mean():.0f} avg per fold',\n",
    "        'AUC':                 f'{wf_df[\"roc_auc\"].mean():.4f} ± {wf_df[\"roc_auc\"].std():.4f}',\n",
    "        '95% CI':              'N/A (cross-fold std reported)',\n",
    "        'Notes':               'More robust; reveals temporal stability',\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'Method':              'Out-of-time (2021–22 train, 2023 test) — LR',\n",
    "        'Train wallets':       int(oot_train_mask.sum()),\n",
    "        'Test wallets':        int(oot_test_mask.sum()),\n",
    "        'AUC':                 f'{lr_auc_oot:.4f}',\n",
    "        '95% CI':              '—',\n",
    "        'Notes':               'Strictest holdout; simulates 2023 deployment',\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'Method':              'Out-of-time (2021–22 train, 2023 test) — LGB',\n",
    "        'Train wallets':       int(oot_train_mask.sum()),\n",
    "        'Test wallets':        int(oot_test_mask.sum()),\n",
    "        'AUC':                 f'{lgb_auc_oot:.4f}',\n",
    "        '95% CI':              '—',\n",
    "        'Notes':               'Strictest holdout; simulates 2023 deployment',\n",
    "    },\n",
    "])\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.set_option('display.max_colwidth', 60)\n",
    "print('\\n=== Validation Results Summary ===')\n",
    "print(summary.to_string(index=False))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Interpretation and next steps\n",
    "\n",
    "### What this analysis shows\n",
    "\n",
    "| Question | Finding |\n",
    "|----------|---------|\n",
    "| Is the original AUC reliable? | No — 205-wallet test yields CI width > 0.08; AUC estimate is noisy |\n",
    "| Does AUC degrade over time? | Walk-forward mean AUC reveals true temporal stability |\n",
    "| Does the model work on unseen 2023 data? | Out-of-time AUC answers this definitively |\n",
    "| Is temporal split the right approach? | Yes — random splits would leak future liquidation events into training |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Limitations that remain\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Label lag**: some wallets in the test set may not have been observed long enough to default — this artificially lowers the test default rate and inflates apparent AUC.\n",
    "2. **Concept drift**: DeFi behavior post-merge (Sep 2022) may differ structurally from pre-merge; the model may not fully capture this shift.\n",
    "3. **Selection bias**: we only indexed 8,800 wallets — those associated with Aave V2 liquidation events. The true population of DeFi borrowers is larger.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Recommendation\n",
    "\n",
    "Report AUC as **mean ± std from walk-forward CV** rather than a single split point.  \n",
    "Use the out-of-time result as the primary production readiness indicator.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "*Proceed to `09_target_variable_analysis.ipynb` for the default proxy methodology.*"
   ]
  }
